# The screen of reference "Opium's songs" (docs/ROADMAP.md) in Spotify, on the owner's account,
# started by scripts/market.sh on a public playlist of 9,998 songs, measured by scripts/measure.py.
# Positions are in logical pixels of the window, 2560 x 1440, alone on its output. A song plays,
# muted in the player first.
still
pointer move 1200 900      # over the table, where the pointer stays
sleep 7
shot open
memory open
measure rest 60
pointer move 2376 1397     # the player's button of sound: muted
sleep 0.6
pointer click
pointer move 1281 1385     # the player's button to play: Like a Rolling Stone, the song loaded
sleep 0.6
pointer click
pointer move 1200 900
sleep 3
shot playing
measure wave 60            # the song plays, muted; its bar of progress moves
memory played
pointer move 1281 1385     # the same button: paused
sleep 0.6
pointer click
pointer move 1200 900
sleep 2
measure scroll 160 every 4.1667 scroll 16   # 16 logical pixels a frame, from the first song to the last
pointer lift               # the fingers leave the touchpad
still
shot scrolled
memory scrolled
pointer move 1037 29       # "Home": the table closes
sleep 0.5
pointer click
sleep 10
shot closed
memory closed
